# n9: pin the GK20A clock as soon as nouveau registers its devfreq device (before greetd/phoc start).
# simple_ondemand (the only governor built) reclocked ~40 times in 3 min; every reclock is a GPC PLL slide,
# the step that timed out and hung the SoC, and a reclock racing GR init left FECS hung for the whole boot
# (notes/gpu.md). min = max = one fixed clock: no transitions. Change both values together.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="devfreq", KERNEL=="57000000.gpu", ATTR{max_freq}="612000000", ATTR{min_freq}="612000000"
